    "sections": {
        "description": "The Creative Designer theme includes a structured layout for presenting creative work, design portfolios, visual projects, and related content in an organized format. It provides sections for featured images, portfolio grids, project descriptions, testimonials, and contact details. The homepage supports customizable banners, content blocks, and gallery displays to highlight design work in a clear visual flow. The theme includes navigation menus, social media integration, blog support, and footer customization options. Its responsive structure ensures proper display across different devices and screen sizes. Additional features include image display options, layout controls, and flexible section arrangement that help maintain a clean and visually focused presentation of design-related content."
    },
